{
  title: "json_decode"
}
---
### NAME

    json_decode() - Deserializes a JSON string into an LPC value.

### SYNOPSIS

    mixed json_decode( string text );

### DESCRIPTION

    Deserializes a JSON string into an LPC value.

### PARAMETERS

    text  (string)
          The JSON string to deserialize.

### RETURN VALUES

    (mixed) The deserialized LPC value.
